-- 登记: A07 | 语义: 把 EQ-M 的 DESC 写回基线值（ident/setup_t3.mac 里的那一句）
-- expected_net: cancelled | restore 搭档: 本文件是 window/meta_only_apply.mac 的 restore
ALPHA LOG "{{LOG_PATH}}" OVER
$P SUITE-T3-WINDOW-META-ONLY-RESTORE-ALIVE
/AIOS-SUITE-T3-EQ-M
Q REF
Q NAME
Q DESC
DESC 'AIOS T3 baseline'
Q DESC
SAVEWORK 'AIOS suite T3 window/meta_only restore: EQ-M DESC back to baseline'
$P SUITE-T3-WINDOW-META-ONLY-RESTORE-DONE
ALPHA LOG END
